# M5b's top bar under the keyboard's focus: Tab from no focus reaches the wordmark first (its
# 3 px ring in --primary at 32 %, radius 6), then the gear (its line --primary under the ring),
# FV 07's order. Chromium tabs to links and buttons as the port does (plan call 3 f); WebKit's
# plain Tab skips them (Safari's "Press Tab to highlight each item" off), so judge this against
# Chromium's reference.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
tab
wait 16
shot focus-wordmark
tab
wait 16
shot focus-gear
